    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Reconciling the corpus with the source\n\nOnce a day on a schedule: the list of files in the Google Drive folder against the list of documents\nin the database. Everything that is no longer in the folder is deleted from the database.\n\n### Why\n\nNo file trigger reports a deletion. Without such a reconciliation, deleted documents\nstay in the index and keep showing up in answers - and that is the worst kind of error, because\nthe answer looks well-founded.\n\n### What to replace before running\n\nGoogle Drive and Supabase credentials, `YOUR_FOLDER_ID` in the folder request, the table name `documents`.\n\n### What it costs\n\nA discrepancy is visible once a day. If you want it faster - a more frequent schedule and more idle runs.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 920,
        "color": 3
      },
